<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>MarketMuse is an enterprise-grade AI content intelligence platform that helps content teams plan, research, and optimize content at scale. Trusted by over 5,000 brands including IBM, Deloitte, and MongoDB, MarketMuse uses advanced AI and natural language processing to analyze your content, identify gaps, and provide strategic recommendations for building topical authority in your niche.</p>
<p>What sets MarketMuse apart is its focus on content strategy and planning rather than just optimization. The platform's proprietary topic modeling technology analyzes your entire content inventory, compares it against competitors, and identifies opportunities to establish expertise and authority. Instead of optimizing individual articles in isolation, MarketMuse helps you build comprehensive content clusters that demonstrate deep subject matter expertise to search engines.</p>
<p>MarketMuse excels at answering strategic questions: What topics should we cover? Where are our content gaps? How comprehensive is our coverage compared to competitors? The platform combines content briefs, competitive analysis, inventory audits, and AI-assisted writing to provide a complete content intelligence solution for serious content marketers and large teams.</p>
